@startuml post-refresh
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/v1/user/refresh
caption CRB-10 · refresh token rotation, DB의 현재 status · type으로 새 토큰 발급

actor Client
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "UserController" as Controller
participant "UserService" as Service
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "RefreshTokenRepository" as RefreshTokenRepository
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Pipe: POST /api/v1/user/refresh\n{ refresh_token }
note right of Client: 가드 없음. access token이 만료된 뒤에도 호출 가능
alt body 검증 실패 (refresh_token 누락 · 빈 문자열)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: refresh(req)
Controller -> Service: refresh(req)
Service -> AuthService: refresh(refresh_token)

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository: deleteByOpaqueHash(SHA-256(refresh_token), tx)
  RefreshTokenRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE refresh_token WHERE opaque_hash = ? RETURNING *
  note right
    기존 토큰을 먼저 소비 (rotation).
    같은 토큰으로 동시에 두 번 refresh하면 한쪽만 행을 받음
  end note
  PostgreSQL --> RefreshTokenRepository: row | 없음
  RefreshTokenRepository --> AuthService: stored | null
  alt 행 없음 (모르는 토큰, 이미 쓴 토큰, 로그아웃 · 탈퇴로 지워진 토큰)
    AuthService -[#red]-> Client: 401 Invalid refresh token
  else expires_at 지남
    AuthService -[#red]-> Client: 401 Refresh token expired
  end

  AuthService -> UserRepository: findByPk(userPk, tx)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT users (is_deleted = false)
  PostgreSQL --> UserRepository: row
  UserRepository --> AuthService: user | null
  alt 유저 없음 (탈퇴)
    AuthService -[#red]-> Client: 401 User not found
  end
  note right of AuthService
    클레임은 DB의 현재 status · type으로 다시 만듦.
    가입 중 유형 변경 · 가입 완료 뒤에 refresh해도 어긋나지 않음
  end note

  AuthService -> AuthService: issueTokens(user, tx)\naccess token 서명 (RS256, sub · type · status)
  AuthService -> RefreshTokenRepository: insert({ opaqueHash, userPk, expiresAt }, tx)
  RefreshTokenRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT refresh_token
  AuthService -> UserRepository: updateLastActiveAt(userPk, tx)
  UserRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE users SET last_active_at = now()
end
note over AuthService, PostgreSQL
  트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답.
  401로 끝나면 기존 토큰 삭제도 rollback되지만, 그 토큰은 이미 쓸 수 없는 상태
end note

AuthService --> Service: { accessToken, refreshToken }
Service --> Controller: { access_token, refresh_token }
Controller --> Client: 201 { access_token, refresh_token }
note right of Client: 응답의 refresh token으로 교체 (기존 토큰은 더 쓸 수 없음)

@enduml
